        <h2>5. Expected Impact</h2>
        <p>
            By integrating the fluid adaptability of <span class="highlight">ATLANTIS</span> with the protective oversight of the <span class="highlight">Constable</span> protocol, we anticipate a 40% reduction in caregiver burnout and a significant increase in reported independence among study participants. This research will lay the groundwork for the next generation of empathetic smart homes.
